erDiagram
    %% Status: illustrative fictional model. Entities have independent primary keys.
    accTitle: Illustrative website and enquiry records
    accDescr: Each website has one owner and zero or more enquiries. Each enquiry belongs to one website. An owner can maintain zero or more websites.
    OWNER ||..o{ WEBSITE : maintains
    WEBSITE ||..o{ ENQUIRY : receives
    OWNER {
        string id PK
    }
    WEBSITE {
        string id PK
        string owner_id FK
    }
    ENQUIRY {
        string id PK
        string website_id FK
    }
